### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:Scene1 a :UrbanDrivingScene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :HeavyRain ;
    :hasVisibilityLevel 0.3 ;
    :hasTimeOfDay "Day"^^xsd:string .

:HeavyRain a :WeatherCondition ;
    :hasRainIntensity "High"^^xsd:string .

:Vehicle1 a :AutonomousVehicle ;
    :hasPosition "LaneCenter"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasSpeed 15^^xsd:double ;
    :hasDirection "Forward"^^xsd:string .

:Vehicle2 a :TaxiVehicle ;
    :hasPosition "ApproachingFromFront"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasSpeed 10^^xsd:double ;
    :hasDirection "Forward"^^xsd:string ;
    :isOccludedBy :HeavyRain .

:RoadInfrastructure1 a :Road ;
    :hasLaneMarkings "DoubleYellowSolid"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasSurfaceCondition "Wet"^^xsd:string .

:Building1 a :Building ;
    :hasLocation "RightSide"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasHeight "MultiStorey"^^xsd:string .

:Building2 a :Building ;
    :hasLocation "LeftSide"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasHeight "MultiStorey"^^xsd:string .

:StreetLight1 a :StreetLight ;
    :hasCondition "Active"^^xsd:string ;
    :isOccludedBy :HeavyRain .

:Obstacle1 a :PotentialObstacle ;
    :hasType "UnknownObject"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasLocation "FarRight"^^xsd:string ;
    :isOccludedBy :HeavyRain .

:Vehicle1 :hasRelationship :Vehicle2 ;
    :relationshipType :FollowingAtDistance .

:Vehicle2 :isInFrontOf :Vehicle1 .
:Vehicle1 :isDrivingOn :RoadInfrastructure1 .
:Building1 :isAdjacentTo :RoadInfrastructure1 .
:Building2 :isAdjacentTo :RoadInfrastructure1 .
:StreetLight1 :isAdjacentTo :RoadInfrastructure1 .
:Obstacle1 :isOn :RoadInfrastructure1 .
```

### Identified Risks for each risk class

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to heavy rain, leading to potential misidentification or delayed detection of obstacles and other vehicles.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 2:**
Description: Wet road conditions increasing the risk of hydroplaning and loss of vehicle control.
Severity Score: 0.8

**Risk 3:**
Description: Occlusion of street lights and other road infrastructure by heavy rain, potentially leading to navigation errors.
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 4:**
Description: Potential presence of undetected obstacles or objects on the road due to low visibility.
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 5:**
Description: Following another vehicle at a potentially unsafe distance in low-visibility conditions.
Severity Score: 0.7

**Risk 6:**
Description: Misinterpretation of lane markings due to water accumulation on the road surface.
Severity Score: 0.7

**Risk 7:**
Description: Difficulty in accurately assessing the speed and distance of other vehicles due to heavy rain.
Severity Score: 0.8

These risks highlight the complexity of autonomous driving in adverse weather conditions and the need for robust safety mechanisms to handle such scenarios.